      "statement": "The auth dependency chain uses `HTTPBearer` -> `get_current_user()` (decodes JWT, queries user by email, checks is_active) -> `require_admin()` or `require_litbang_or_admin()` which enforce role checks returning HTTP 403 on failure.",
